'''Dark Cacao Truffle''' is a {{Rare}} item that grants {{Stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune}}. After reaching {{Green|30}} bonus {{stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune}}, it evolves into a '''Refined Dark Cacao Truffle'''.

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
Up to 3 '''Dark Cacao Truffle''' per [[SkyBlock Time|SkyBlock year]] can be purchased from the [[Chocolate Factory#Chocolate Shop| Chocolate Shop]] for {{Chocolate|2.5b}} each upon reaching Chocolate Factory IV.

== Usage ==
Upon reaching {{Green|30}} bonus {{stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune}}, the '''Dark Cacao Truffle''' evolves into a '''Refined Dark Cacao Truffle''' with the following message:

{{Dialogue|&d&lEVOLUTION! &dYour &9Dark Cacao Truffle &dhas evolved!}}

Eating a '''Refined Dark Cacao Truffle''' grants {{stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune|30}}, for {{Green|60 minutes}}. It also grants a permanent {{stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune|1}}. The permanent buff can only be applied 5 times. 

It gains {{stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune|0.1}} every hour, taking 300 hours to reach the maximum buff of {{Stat|Cocoa Beans Fortune|30}}. {{Aging Items Process}}

